'''Kombat 4on4''' will be a 4on4 tournament starting in 2025, '''January 19'''. The maps will consist of the classical tb3, schloss and a new map called [[Steam]]

== Format ==
* Start date: 2025, '''January 19'''
* Group stage into playoffs
** 4 teams per group <small>(number of groups/divs depend on signups)</small>
** Single elimination playoffs
* 1 match per week
* Every match start on map STEAM
* Group matches are {{Abbr|GO3|Best of 3}}
* Playoff matches are {{Abbr|BO5|Best of 5}}
== Sign up ==
* Signup: message {{player|alice|flag=se}} on Discord.

